### Ideal-only exactness changes

- Lemon FCF replaces Cedrat one-for-one for a more literal lemon-peel edge.
- White Pepper EO replaces Black Pepper EO one-for-one for a paler, less earthy pepper register.
- Ginger CO2 at 10% replaces 50 parts of Jessemal to supply true warm rhizome interior while Ginger EO retains the wet-cut surface.
- Violet Leaf Absolute at 10% replaces 40 parts of Parmavert to add natural leafy-metallic complexity without turning the heart into iris.
- Cedarwood Virginia takes 300 of the 430 current Cedarwood EO parts; 130 parts of the current cedar and 290 Himalayan parts remain to preserve breadth and depth.
- Haitian Vetiver takes 120 of the 210 current Indian vetiver parts; 90 Indian parts remain as a darker root shadow.

