The model continues to retain ginger, citrus, Hedione HC, and Iso E Super strongly at four hours. Treat that as a stock-rebase/OAV-per-time guard against abrupt collapse, not as measured evaporation or proof of the desired transition. Physical smelling must decide whether the ginger feels dimensional or merely loud, whether the heart reads violet leaf rather than floral abstraction, and whether the 53 rows form one perfume rather than spectral crowding.

