No direct raw-stock aliquot in the current formula is below 10 uL. Prepare these stocks so the small active doses are measured from at least 10 uL of a labeled stock:

| Stock to prepare | Preparation | Formula aliquot | Neat equivalent | Reason |
|---|---|---:|---:|---|
| Citral 10% in DPG | Combine 100 uL Citral + 900 uL DPG; mix and label exact basis/date | 20 uL | 2 uL | Direct 2 uL neat would violate the raw-stock floor |
